ss_133ceca1aefe8ac36c0325311d4c7999e041502a.600x338.jpg?t=1746604173"},{"id":11,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/98bacc98308fd72ad779f599fe725ba661b78bf5/ss_98bacc98308fd72ad779f599fe725ba661b78bf5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746604173","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358040/98bacc98308fd72ad779f599fe725ba661b78bf5/ss_98bacc98308fd72ad779f599fe725ba661b78bf5.600x338.jpg?t=1746604173"}],"short_description":"Become the CEO of a AAA game studio and run it like a casino roguelike! Business is about winning big, after all, and your employees are the bargaining chips. Fire people, grow your network, call in favors, and do whatever it takes to satisfy shareholders - and that means maximizing profit!","steam_appid":3358040,"support_info":{"email":"nicvb@whitelockemedia.com","url":"https://whitelockemedia.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://whitelockemedia.com/"}